WEBVTT

00:15:25.516 --> 00:15:31.956
We must, must pay more attention to
the power and importance of the emotions

00:15:31.996 --> 00:15:33.756
in taking care of our hearts.

00:15:34.436 --> 00:15:36.796
Emotional stress, I have learned,

00:15:36.796 --> 00:15:39.676
is often a matter of life and death.

00:15:41.036 --> 00:15:42.196
Thank you.

00:15:42.236 --> 00:15:47.556
(Applause)